          <svg class="mx-auto h-10 w-10 text-rose-500/40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9.983 3v7.391c0 5.704-3.731 9.57-8.983 10.609l-.995-2.151c2.432-.917 3.995-3.638 3.995-5.849h-4v-10h9.983zm14.017 0v7.391c0 5.704-3.748 9.571-9 10.609l-.996-2.151c2.433-.917 3.996-3.638 3.996-5.849h-3.983v-10h9.983z"/></svg>
          <blockquote class="mt-4 text-xl font-medium text-slate-200">We used to spend two weeks before every audit updating spreadsheets that were already out of date. Now we download a PDF from the last build and forward it. The first time I handed the auditor a file:line report, they asked me if it was real.</blockquote>
